WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:06.740
Wha'ts up everybody!

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.560
We are Pongfinity

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.560
Today we are finding out if it's possible

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.280
To play table tennis with different fruits

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.120
Let's start off with the lime!

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.280
By the way, last month only 15 % of our watchers were subscribers

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.820
So please help our channel and hit subscribe!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.620
There is my best lime serve!

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.900
Match to 3 points.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.780
Red apple versus green apple!

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.680
That was... decent!

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.880
Deciding point!

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:03.740
Good match!

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:05.500
I should have chosen the red apple.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.460
I didn't see that coming!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.720
This is what you do when you get hungry

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:31.960
During practice.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.640
It's a good banana!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.800
For each around the net shot that Otto makes

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:28.840
I will feed him a grape.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.320
Let's see how much he loves them.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.780
A lot!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.060
Nice shotto!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.100
Thank you!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.900
Also worth a grape!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:50.820
Not bad!

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.680
These are really good grapes!

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.540
Otto is pretty hungry today

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.520
I will run out of grapes soon...

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.740
So now I have made a racket out of the pineapple.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.380
Let's try!

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.120
My technique is perfect for this!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.140
Pretty good!

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.400
What a mess!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.660
One bite between every shot.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.640
Let's go!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.280
How did it go Miikka?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.940
I didn't have time to swallow the apple!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.880
Ok, turns out you can play table tennis with fruits!

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.960
Remember to subscribe to our channel here

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.000
And watch our previous episodes there!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.680
Until next time!

